cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Lambda: An Open Sheep Brain Study Guide"
message: >-
  If you use this module in your teaching or reference it in
  scholarship, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Torry"
    family-names: "Dennis"
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
repository-code: "https://github.com/torryscott/lambda"
abstract: >-
  An open sheep brain study guide: an interactive labeled atlas of a
  preserved sheep brain across twelve views, a self-quiz on the same
  structures, and a glossary of every structure with its definition.
  Instructors choose which structures are included through a link,
  without editing anything. Built to WCAG 2.1 AA, with keyboard- and
  screen-reader-accessible study modes.
keywords:
  - neuroanatomy
  - anatomy education
  - sheep brain
  - interactive atlas
  - open educational resources
license: MIT
license-url: "https://github.com/torryscott/lambda/blob/main/LICENSE"
